  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feed 10000 poor in Bihar, India this Ramadhan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">No other month encourages acts of charity more than Ramadhan. The giving spirit during this month allows MRA to distribute Ramadhan assistance to needy communities around the world, including in India. The volatile condition of post-Covid-19 worsens livelihood for vulnerable communities in poor states such as Bihar. This Ramadhan, MRA will distribute food and essential assistance to 10000 beneficiaries in Bihar, India. This Ramadhan, your good deed is a blessing to another.</narrative>
  </description>
